000324r 2  E5 C7                sbc q5
000326r 2  60                   rts
000327r 2               
000327r 2               ; gettileattr: A = attribute byte for the tile at (qx,qy): bits0-2 push+3, bit7 kill ; 3 if outside
000327r 2               gettileattr:
000327r 2  20 rr rr             jsr tilexy                  ; X = qx>>3, A = qy>>3
