00127Cr 2               ; A box star is an opaque rectangle, so if the same frame is already on screen in the
00127Cr 2               ; same place its pixels are still right -- unless something has been drawn through
00127Cr 2               ; them.  The converter marks the stars an enemy's range covers; the rest can still be
00127Cr 2               ; walked through by Cleo or the boomerang, which the collect check tests for with a
00127Cr 2               ; band widened from "close enough to pick up" to "the rectangles touch".  Safe ones
00127Cr 2               ; are drawn under an alias id BOXN above the real one.
