001513r 2               @norst: ; rise = (A*A >> 3) - 28 while the snake is up.
001513r 2                       ; NOTE: the reference skips when A <= -16 (CleoApp.run 2865: bipush -16,
001513r 2                       ; if_icmple), so it is up for A >= -15.  This port has always used A >= -16 -- one
001513r 2                       ; frame earlier.  Kept as it was, because a representation change should not carry
001513r 2                       ; a behaviour change: threshold 113 below instead of 112 matches the reference,
001513r 2                       ; and costs 18 frames of 300 on L7.
001513r 2  A5 AC                lda fa
